(6875639, 1035485, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite shots in the bunch.<br/> <br/>Love the colors, the softness of the background/foreground and the sharpness of the subject.  <br/> <br/>It''s a very "dark" image... yet, very powerful.  The title speaks mounds to the image.<br/> <br/>Very well done!  9</td>', 'This is one of my favorite shots in the bunch. Love the colors, the softness of the background/foreground and the sharpness of the subject.   It''s a very "dark" image... yet, very powerful.  The title speaks mounds to the image. Very well done!  9', '2012-10-04 14:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6875640, 1035667, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  Love the reflections.  <br/>The black and white is a great touch.<br/>It''s a very intriguing picture, you can actually develop a story in your mind while looking at this photograph.  <br/>Great exposure, nice angle... well done.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  Love the reflections.  The black and white is a great touch.It''s a very intriguing picture, you can actually develop a story in your mind while looking at this photograph.  Great exposure, nice angle... well done.', '2012-10-04 14:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6875642, 1035744, 134859, '<td valign="top">I adore this shot.<br/> <br/>It is my favorite.<br/> <br/>The DOF is perfect.  The lighting works well.  <br/>Black and white conversion is a great choice.<br/> <br/>It''s an image that I''m sure not many people see the "beauty" in.  But it''s amazing!  Well done</td>', 'I adore this shot. It is my favorite. The DOF is perfect.  The lighting works well.  Black and white conversion is a great choice. It''s an image that I''m sure not many people see the "beauty" in.  But it''s amazing!  Well done', '2012-10-04 14:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6875652, 1035765, 29490, '<td valign="top">I feel a different crop, one just below the cross bar (just on top of #70''s helmet), would have really focused the photo on the young lady. ... Or is the focus meant to be the person peeking out from behind the cheerleader?? A dual-portrait portrait!  Tres-cool!  That''s just, like, my opinion, man.<br/> <br/>Good b/w conversion.</td>', 'I feel a different crop, one just below the cross bar (just on top of #70''s helmet), would have really focused the photo on the young lady. ... Or is the focus meant to be the person peeking out from behind the cheerleader?? A dual-portrait portrait!  Tres-cool!  That''s just, like, my opinion, man. Good b/w conversion.', '2012-10-04 14:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
