(6876306, 1035760, 89341, '<td valign="top">A few technical issue for me, image is very soft and there seems to be some haloing around the person (maybe from shadow / highlights) , white balance seems off. I think it would also work better if you could see the persons face even just slightly ... if the person was still you could also try 1/2 - 1 second shutter speed (assuming you could support the camera) to make the person stand out from the waves</td>', 'A few technical issue for me, image is very soft and there seems to be some haloing around the person (maybe from shadow / highlights) , white balance seems off. I think it would also work better if you could see the persons face even just slightly ... if the person was still you could also try 1/2 - 1 second shutter speed (assuming you could support the camera) to make the person stand out from the waves', '2012-10-05 09:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876307, 1035320, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great isolation of the subject, love it</td>', 'Great isolation of the subject, love it', '2012-10-05 09:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
